y the tools of machine learning to predict which passengers survived the tragedy. This Kaggle Getting Started Competition provides an ideal starting place for people who may not have a lot of experience in data science and machine learning.\"","topics":[],"score":216455,"global_rank":230283},{"name":"nimakam/attoco","owner":"nimakam","html_url":"https://github.com/nimakam/attoco","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"Attoco LLC","topics":[],"score":216455,"global_rank":230285},{"name":"daresnick/Data-Science-SMU","owner":"daresnick","html_url":"https://github.com/daresnick/Data-Science-SMU","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"Data Science at SMU repo for class work","topics":[],"score":216450,"global_rank":230290},{"name":"andrwwrios/Weather-Web-App","owner":"andrwwrios","html_url":"https://github.com/andrwwrios/Weather-Web-App","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"Weather Web App","topics":[],"score":216448,"global_rank":230304},{"name":"s-graham42/initiative_tracker","owner":"s-graham42","html_url":"https://github.com/s-graham42/initiative_tracker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216444,"global_rank":230331},{"name":"imann24/remembering-laura","owner":"imann24","html_url":"https://github.com/imann24/remembering-laura","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"A site to memorialize Laura Mann, my mother","topics":[],"score":216444,"global_rank":230333},{"name":"bajohn/opinionator-dead","owner":"bajohn","html_url":"https://github.com/bajohn/opinionator-dead","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216444,"global_rank":230334},{"name":"matyevaa/dinurs_honey_company","owner":"matyevaa","html_url":"https://github.com/matyevaa/dinurs_honey_company","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":